<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 16-JAN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 16-JAN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 17P, with 45 mph winds, is well northeast of New Zealand near 30s/170w, moving south southwest at 20 mph. 17P is weakening and is a decreasing threat to shipping.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
